text:
Rae: Heads-up team — planning a short 'Benchmark Briefing' send + live demo next Thu. Need final subject, RSVP gating, segmentation, and routing rules.
Diego: Core cohorts: trial-30d, newsletter-open-30d, docs-downloaders. Docs-downloaders = high-intent; treat them as invite-first.
Sana: RSVP form: name, email, company, role, team_size, "interested_in_demo" yes/no, plus a one-question reason picker (benchmark/cost/ops). Hidden UTMs: utm_campaign=beacon_briefing, utm_medium=email, cohort={cohort}.
Ivy: Subject candidates: 1) "Benchmark Briefing: latency & cost at scale" 2) "Live demo: how we trimmed inference costs". Tests: emoji vs no-emoji for trials only; docs-downloaders get a personalized variant.
Rae: Suppress: anyone who attended or RSVP'd in last 60d, unsubscribed, or hard-bounced. Dedupe across cohorts (highest intent wins). Also exclude opens in last 7d for benchmark email to avoid fatigue.
Diego: Routing pseudo-rule (will implement in webhook):
```
if (role =~ /(Head|Director|CTO|PM|ML)/ || team_size >= 500 || cohort == "docs-downloaders") {
  route = "sdr-enterprise"
} else if (cohort == "trial") {
  route = "sdr-trial"
} else {
  route = "sdr-nurture"
}
```
Sana: Confirmation flow: RSVP -> thank-you page + calendar add. If route==sdr-enterprise or interested_in_demo==yes then surface "book a demo" button and set lead_score=high.
Ivy: Preheader ideas: "Thu 9AM PT — 20min demo + Q&A" or "See latency, cost, and ops tradeoffs live". Keep under 80 chars.
tooling-bot: Note: webhook deploy scheduled Wed 18:30 PT -> staging. Please QA mapping of utm, cohort, role, team_size, and lead_score.
Rae: Owners: Sana (RSVP form + hidden fields), Diego (routing rules & webhook), Ivy (copy + subject tests), tooling-bot (deploy). We'll run a 15m pre-send check Wed 3PM PT. Ping with green when staging pass is done.
Sana: I'll run a dry submit in staging and confirm CRM lead mapping after deploy.
